---
/*
 * Privacy Policy (English) — 한국어 개인정보 처리방침(src/pages/privacy.astro)의 영문판입니다.
 * ⚠️ 한국어판을 고치면 이 파일도 함께 고치세요. App Store Connect에는 /en/privacy 를 영문 URL로 쓸 수 있습니다.
 */
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../config/site';

const { company, legal } = site;
const name = company.legalNameEn;
---

<DocLayout title="Privacy Policy" meta={`Effective ${legal.effectiveDateEn}`}>
  <p class="note">
    This is an English translation of our Korean Privacy Policy, provided for convenience. If the two versions differ, the
    Korean version applies.
  </p>
  <p>
    {name} (“we”, “us”) follows the Personal Information Protection Act of Korea and other applicable laws. This policy explains
    how we handle the personal information of people who use the Dearbe app (the “Service”).
  </p>

  <h2 id="purpose">1. Why we process personal information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Account sign-up and management: identifying you, checking your age, and preventing misuse</li>
    <li>Providing the Service: conversations with AI companions, remembering conversation context, and personalized replies</li>
    <li>Keeping the Service safe: blocking harmful content, handling reports, and pointing people to professional help in a crisis</li>
    <li>Paid features: confirming purchases and granting access (payments are processed by Apple)</li>
    <li>Customer support and service announcements</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="items">2. What we collect</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th scope="col">Category</th><th scope="col">Information</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Required</td><td>Email address or Sign in with Apple identifier, nickname, birth year (for age checks)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Using the Service</td><td>Conversation content, character settings, usage history, device information (OS and app version)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Paid features</td><td>Purchase history (transaction IDs). We never collect card numbers or other payment details.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Support requests</td><td>Email address and the content of your request</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 id="ai">3. How we handle conversations</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Conversations are processed to generate replies and remember context. They are encrypted in transit and at rest.</li>
    <li>You can delete individual conversations or your entire chat history at any time in the app settings.</li>
    <li>
      If we ever use conversations to improve the Service, we will ask for your separate consent first and pseudonymize the data so it
      can't identify you. You can withdraw that consent at any time.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="retention">4. How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We delete your personal information without delay when you delete your account, unless the law requires us to keep it longer.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Records of contracts and cancellations: 5 years (Act on Consumer Protection in Electronic Commerce)</li>
    <li>Records of consumer complaints and disputes: 3 years (Act on Consumer Protection in Electronic Commerce)</li>
    <li>Access logs: 3 months (Protection of Communications Secrets Act)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="third-party">5. Sharing with third parties</h2>
  <p>We don't share your personal information with third parties unless you agree or the law requires it.</p>

  <h2 id="outsourcing">6. Service providers and international transfers</h2>
  <p>We work with the following service providers to run the Service.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th scope="col">Provider</th><th scope="col">What they do</th><th scope="col">Country</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>[Cloud provider]</td><td>Data storage and server operations</td><td>[Country]</td></tr>
      <tr><td>[AI model provider]</td><td>Generating conversation replies</td><td>[Country]</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 id="destruction">7. How we delete it</h2>
  <p>
    When the retention period ends or the information is no longer needed, we delete it without delay. Electronic files are erased so
    they can't be recovered, and paper records are shredded or incinerated.
  </p>

  <h2 id="rights">8. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to access, correct, delete, or stop the processing of your personal information at any time, either in the app settings
    or by contacting us below. You can delete your account yourself in the app under <strong>Settings &gt; Account &gt; Delete Account</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="children">9. Children</h2>
  <p>The Service isn't available to children under 14. If we learn that an account belongs to someone under 14, we delete it without delay.</p>

  <h2 id="security">10. How we keep it safe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Encryption of personal information in transit and at rest</li>
    <li>Access limited to the people who need it, with access logs kept</li>
    <li>Regular privacy training for staff who handle personal information</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="cookies">11. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
  <p>
    This website doesn't use cookies. The app may collect anonymous usage statistics to improve the Service, and you can turn this off
    in your device settings.
  </p>

  <h2 id="officer">12. Privacy officer</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th scope="row">Privacy officer</th><td>{company.privacyOfficerEn}</td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Email</th><td><a href={`mailto:${company.supportEmail}`}>{company.supportEmail}</a></td></tr>
      {company.phone && <tr><th scope="row">Phone</th><td>{company.phone}</td></tr>}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 id="remedy">13. Where else to get help</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Personal Information Dispute Mediation Committee: 1833-6972 (www.kopico.go.kr)</li>
    <li>Personal Information Infringement Report Center: 118 (privacy.kisa.or.kr)</li>
    <li>Supreme Prosecutors’ Office, Cybercrime Investigation: 1301 (www.spo.go.kr)</li>
    <li>Korean National Police Agency, Cyber Bureau: 182 (ecrm.police.go.kr)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="changes">14. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    This policy takes effect on {legal.effectiveDateEn}. If we change it, we'll post a notice in the app and on this website at least 7
    days before the change takes effect.
  </p>
</DocLayout>
